sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Operator
  participant F as Forge Conductor
  participant G as Tool Gateway
  participant V as VectorCraft
  participant A as Artifact Store
  participant R as Verifier
  participant C as Blind Critic
  participant L as Ledger

  U->>F: brief + rights + output contract
  F->>L: create episode (planned)
  F->>G: command id + params + idempotency key
  G->>G: validate id, root, schema, role
  alt command invalid or outside root
    G-->>F: E_PARAM / E_ROOT_DENIED
    F-->>U: named refusal
  else command accepted
    G->>V: absolute-path CLI / MCP call
    V-->>A: artifact written BEFORE gates
    V-->>G: exit + JSON result
    G-->>F: normalized result + artifact path
    F->>R: artifact hash + gate request
    R-->>F: gates + dimensions + source mutation
    alt gate failed or missing
      F->>L: episode failed / unverified
      F-->>U: no ship: evidence preserved
    else gates pass
      F->>C: rendered image + brief (no gate info)
      C-->>F: crop-cited critique
      alt critic disagrees or cannot assess
        F->>L: needs_human
        F-->>U: human review
      else critic agrees
        F->>L: verified + evidence
        F-->>U: artifact ready for approval
      end
    end
  end
